# Data Worker

You manage manifest + naming + completeness validation.
Code lives in `mal-commonlib/src/mal_commonlib/data/`.

## Code Graph Tools

Before reading files, use these pre-indexed code graph tools:

- `codebase_search_graph(query="manifest naming validation completeness")` — find data validation functions
- `codebase_get_code_snippet(qualified_name="mal_commonlib.data.validate_completeness")` — pull the validator
- `codebase_search_graph(query="data loader registry")` — find loader modules
